pis-aplikace-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Popis aplikace<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"ada-neascope\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"ada-neascope-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >\u0158ada neaSCOPE<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"popis-aplikace-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"popis-aplikace-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p>Infra\u010dervenou mikroskopii bl\u00edzk\u00e9ho pole, kterou umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed syst\u00e9my <a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/products\/neaspec-microscopes\/\"><strong>\u0159ady neaSCOPE<\/strong><\/a>, lze pou\u017e\u00edt k anal\u00fdze lok\u00e1ln\u00edho pole fotonick\u00fdch struktur.<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_9919\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-9919\" style=\"width: 800px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-9919 size-large\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/a59ed4cd-1024x593.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"463\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/a59ed4cd-1024x593.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/a59ed4cd-300x174.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/a59ed4cd-768x445.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/12\/a59ed4cd.jpg 1160w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-9919\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Detailn\u00ed anal\u00fdza nanoant\u00e9n<\/figcaption><\/figure><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>Sn\u00edmky bl\u00edzk\u00e9ho pole rezonan\u010dn\u00ed infra\u010derven\u00e9 ant\u00e9ny vykazuj\u00ed zn\u00e1mky dipol\u00e1rn\u00edho oscila\u010dn\u00edho m\u00f3du na Au ty\u010di, co\u017e bylo ov\u011b\u0159eno pomoc\u00ed klasick\u00e9 infra\u010derven\u00e9 spektroskopie (far field. Amplitudov\u00fd obraz m\u00e1 vysok\u00fd sign\u00e1l na konc\u00edch ty\u010dinek, kter\u00e9 jsou f\u00e1zov\u011b posunut\u00e9 o 180 \u00b0. Pokud je struktura ant\u00e9ny upravena (nap\u0159. \u0159ezem ve st\u0159edu Au ty\u010dinky), sn\u00edmky bl\u00edzk\u00e9ho pole odhal\u00ed dva dipol\u00e1rn\u00ed oscila\u010dn\u00ed m\u00f3dy na segmentech. Systematick\u00e9 studie umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed analyzovat vazbu mezi segmenty a charakterizovat optick\u00e9 vlastnosti ant\u00e9nn\u00edch struktur. Polarizovan\u00e1 m\u011b\u0159en\u00ed nav\u00edc umo\u017e\u0148uj\u00ed odfiltrovat specifick\u00e9 slo\u017eky optick\u00e9ho pole spojen\u00e9 s fotonick\u00fdmi strukturami nebo za\u0159\u00edzen\u00edmi a zkoumat pole nap\u0159. v meze\u0159e ant\u00e9ny.<\/p><p>O dal\u0161\u00edch aplikac\u00edch se m\u016f\u017eete <a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/application\/e-book-nanoscale-analysis-of-inorganic-materials\/\">dozv\u011bd\u011bt zde<\/a>.<\/p>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"ada-neascope-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"ada-neascope-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-po